  "description": "In-Ha was always compared to Ye-Jun. Just as she was growing weary of the endless comparisons, she happened to receive an art award that brought her some attention, and so In-Ha began to pursue the path of art. Eight years later, she reunites with Ye-Jun... only to find that he, too, is now doing art. Believing it's inevitable that she'll once again be compared to him, In-Ha starts making plans to distance herself from Ye-Jun. A coming-of-age romance about In-Ha, who harbors a dislike for Ye-Jun.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)\n\n*Note: Includes five extra chapters.*",
